  ===== Heisenberg N=4 | M=16 | G=3 | p-shift: 96 circuits, depth 12, 3 cx =====
  k     circuits   depth     cx  x p-shift depth  TOTAL cx  x p-shift cx
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  1            4     173     83             14.4       332          1.15
