  Depth should roughly double per ancilla: the controlled-U^(2^a) ladder
  costs (2^k - 1)*tau0 of evolution. If k=1 lands within ~5x of
  parameter-shift, the NISQ-viable setting exists and the k=4 default is
  buying accuracy with coherence.
